"use strict";

/* generated from story/scenes/act1_ch5.md — do not edit */

Object.assign(ENEMIES,{weasel:{name:"Moonfang Weasel",hp:16,open:"The spirit beast's eyes are two cold moons. Frost crackles in its fur.",
  moves:[{n:"Frost bite",d:4},{n:"Raking claws",d:3},{n:"Coiling low",kind:"charge",text:"It coils, haunches trembling, moonlight pooling in its jaws.",tele:"It is coiling to pounce."},{n:"Moonfang pounce",d:8,kind:"release"}]}});


SC["a1c5_audit"]={t:()=>SYS(`CHAPTER FIVE — THE GARDEN WAR`)+P(`The first frost arrives, and with it, a problem of arithmetic.`)+P(`The medicine garden on the second terrace has been losing spirit-herbs for a month, raided at night, the stewards say, by beasts off the mountain's wild shoulder. The fines for unguarded losses roll downhill the way everything on this mountain does, and they are landing on the gardeners' families.`)+((G.f.a1_qiu_books)?(P(`Except you have seen Qiu's other ledger, and you have the kind of memory that doesn't let go. The herb shortfalls started <i>before</i> the first raid was ever reported. Three entries, neat as stitches: cloudpith, silverroot, dawn-ear. Something was skimming that garden while it still had a fence's worth of reputation. And then, very conveniently, the beasts began.`)):(((G.f.a1_ledger_in)?(P(`Except Bao's betting book has a long memory, and so do you. The kitchen odds on "garden fined again this month" shortened two weeks before the first raid was ever reported. Somebody was betting on losses before there were losses to bet on.`)):(P(`Except the numbers smell wrong even from the wash-yard. Beasts eat what beasts eat — but the garden's losses, the way the under-servants tell it, are exactly the three herbs that fetch silver down-mountain: cloudpith, silverroot, dawn-ear. Hungry animals are not connoisseurs.`))))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Keep your arithmetic to yourself, for now — and keep your eyes on that garden.`,go:"c2_garden"}]};

SC["c2_garden"]={t:()=>P(`Deep autumn. Mei finds you at the woodpile, breathless, eyes red. “The medicine garden — something's been raiding the spirit-herbs at night. The stewards docked my family's whole season's pay for it. If it happens again they'll expel me.”`)+P(`You go with her that night and crouch in the frost-stiff rows. Near midnight it comes over the wall: long, low, silver: a Moonfang Weasel, a true spirit beast, frost smoking off its fur, and it looks at the two of you the way you look at dumplings.`)+((G.pats.razor)?(P(`Mei has a smoke-pot and a paring knife. You have the Weave.`)):(P(`Mei has a smoke-pot and a paring knife. You have the Weave. Your hands move with no plan at all, and under terror's pressure, a thread pulls taut and <i>sharpens</i>. Desperation is also a teacher.`))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Stand between the beast and Mei.`,do:()=>{if(!G.pats.razor)learn("razor","Razor Thread");},go:"c2_weasel"}]};

SC["c2_weasel"]={img:"weasel",
 combat:"weasel",
 win:"c2_weasel_win",
 lose:"c2_weasel_lose",
 t:()=>""};

SC["c2_weasel_win"]={t:()=>P(`The weasel comes apart at the seams — literally; your last knot unpicks the binding of frost-qi that holds its form, and it collapses into a drift of silver mist around a single gleaming bead. A beast core.`)+P(`Mei stares at you, smoke-pot forgotten. “You're not a cripple,” she says slowly. “You're something there isn't a word for.” She doesn't step back when she says it. She steps <i>closer</i>.`)+SYS(`Beast core acquired. Mei knows your secret — and guards it like her own.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Crush the core and study how its frost-pattern was knotted.`,do:()=>{addIns(2);G.hp=G.maxhp;note("Mei watches a season of her family's docked wages dissolve into silver mist between your fingers. She doesn't say anything. That's the loudest part.");},go:"a1c5_bait"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Give it to Mei — sold quietly, it repays her family's docked wages twice over.`,do:()=>{G.mei+=3;note("Mei +3");G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c5_bait"}]};

SC["c2_weasel_lose"]={t:()=>P(`The pounce catches you. The world goes white, then smoke: Mei has hurled the smoke-pot into the beast's eyes, and it flees yowling over the wall with half the harvest.`)+P(`She gets you to her grandmother's shed and stitches the worst of it, hands steady, jaw tight. “I saw,” she says quietly. “The gold light. I saw, and I'm not telling anyone, and you're going to teach me what you are when you can sit up.”`)+SYS(`Defeat. But a secret shared is half a friendship.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.mei+=1;note("Mei +1");addIns(1);G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c5_bait"}]};

SC["a1c5_bait"]={t:()=>P(`It's Mei who finds it, two rows over, while you're still catching your breath: a little clay pot, half-buried at the base of the wall, packed with rendered marrow and crushed dawn-ear.`)+P(`Bait. Shop-made, shop-bought. Moonfang Weasels live two valleys over and do not cross a warded ridge for vegetables. But they will swim a river for marrow-fat. Somebody invited that animal. Somebody has been inviting it for a month, to walk beast tracks over the neat little hole in the garden's books.`)+((G.f.a1_ledger_in)?(P(`Bao runs the pot's maker-stamp through the basement in a day and a half. The chandler remembers the buyer: young, soft-handed, smelled of ink. The abacus boy. Qiu's nephew — the same patron whose allowance bleeds every time Liu Feng trips a servant.`)):(P(`It takes you a week of carried water and careful questions to walk the pot backward: chandler, errand-boy, counting room. Young, soft-handed, smelled of ink. The abacus boy. Qiu's nephew — Feng's patron, the counting room's heir.`)))+P(`The shape of it sits in your chest, cold and complete. Qiu skims the garden. The nephew baits the wall. The beast takes the blame, the fines land on gardeners' families, and Mei's mother pays for a steward's silver. Small crimes have owners, and this one has an address.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`The question is not whether to pull this thread. It's which way.`,go:"a1c5_reckoning"}]};

SC["a1c5_reckoning"]={t:()=>P(`You hold three ends of one knot, and a night to choose.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Expose them — bait-pot, ledger lines, chandler's memory — formally, to the outer court's discipline board.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_qiu_exposed=true;G.f.a1_bao_debts=true;note("The board strips Qiu of his books within the week. Justice, loud and public — and in the scouring that follows, Bao's little bet-book burns with everything else, and his firewood debts triple. He says it's fine. He says it twice.");},go:"c2_realm"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Go to Qiu quietly, lay one copied line and the bait-pot on his desk, and name your price: Mei's family made whole, the fines reversed, and a steward who owes you.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_leverage=true;G.mei+=1;note("Mei +1. The fines reverse as 'clerical error.' Qiu writes you into his other ledger now — the one of people he fears — and you discover that being feared by a careful man is a strange, heavy coin.");},go:"c2_realm"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Hand all of it to Auntie Tang, and let the basement police its own.`,do:()=>{G.tang+=2;G.f.a1_tang_owes=true;note("Tang +2. Nothing happens that anyone could testify to. But the nephew develops a horror of kitchens, Qiu's skim goes quiet, a season of fines is repaid in 'misplaced' stores — and from that week on, your bowl comes off the white soup pot.");},go:"c2_realm"}]};

SC["c2_realm"]={t:()=>((G.insight>=6)?(P(`That night, turning the whole knotted month over and over, something gives way — like the last face of a puzzle clicking home. Knots are not the unit. <i>Fabric</i> is. You fall asleep mid-thought and wake at dawn with six threads answering your call where four answered before.`)+SYS(`Insight bears fruit.`)):(P(`You feel the next realm out there like a door you can touch but not yet open. More understanding. You need more understanding.`))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Winter closes over the mountain.`,do:()=>{if(G.insight>=6&&G.realm<2)realmUp();},go:"a1c6_watcher"}]};